<title>USA: Idaho $300 mln one-year notes yield 3.88 pct.</title>
<headline>Idaho $300 mln one-year notes yield 3.88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc. said Tuesday it priced Idaho's $300 million tax anticipation note deal with a 4-5/8 percent coupon to yield 3.88 percent.</p>
<p>The notes are due on June 30, 1998.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
